        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Wonderful dance studio. We're in our 3rd year dancing there and our son loves it. The staff are all very welcoming and do their best to include kids even when they're shy. The dance shows at the end of the year are also tons of fun and very engaging. We'll be signing up our younger son as soon as he's old enough.",
