        "text": "Best hip hop classes in the world!",
        "time": 1739634769,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Melanie Levesque",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103784679999823742646/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ610JYrRKez81F6uF0iS__E5DfBX_rXSx1pdg0m7S_Dyx1Ng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "My daughter has been going to Studio 118 for 4 years. We discovered them through their summer day camps and have been there ever since. Whether it's for recreational classes, troop, or day camps, all the teachers are involved and passionate. I highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1740686808,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joannie Christmas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111945912723298395335/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX2ELZ4vFt8vQfmi6IULs2AYcK1-Ct1LBsX7oAtItjs9O5Yg-M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "An exceptional studio that embodies wonderful values! As soon as I step inside, I feel right at home. The atmosphere is welcoming and supportive, and you immediately sense that everyone belongs.\n\nMy daughter and I are students at the studio, and I have nothing but praise. For my daughter, settling in wasn't easy at first, but thanks to her teacher's gentleness and patience, she persevered and gained confidence. We're ready for another session!\n\nThe service is top-notch! Thank you, Studio 118!",
        "time": 1737998101,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Luc Deveault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117099450965007138261/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEmlp1gnkJt9d0mpmtz_L6wCz0DmTdIePuXd6yGpVgC9aOC1RFaw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Great studio.\nMy daughter loves the friendly staff and feels very motivated. Dance classes are offered in a wide variety of styles by experienced staff who are dedicated to our success. Many, if not all, of the dance troupes travel to competitions in various locations in the region and beyond (Ste-Hyacinthe and Lévis).",
